  "notes": [
    "Demo loader for Multi Hot 20 and Burn Wilds reported country restriction in Cloudflare Playwright; the existing archive contains earlier captured demo media.",
    "Every currently prepared patch is staged on the GitHub work branch, not deployed into superwin-player production.",
    "No unverified slot payout math or screenshot-as-game substitutions are accepted.",
    "Five additional games' overlapping TURBO hit areas were corrected per game and verified with Playwright across 360/390/412px; no public asset deployment has occurred.",
    "Dedicated original 5x3 Canvas scenes for Multi Hot 20 and Burn Wilds were browser-tested with synthetic QA sprites; strict production mode refuses missing real symbol atlases, and no public route, verified server math or authenticated ETB wagering has been activated.",
    "2026-11-21: Multi Hot 20 and Burn Wilds official-capture media and all 16 source files staged in existing Cloudflare SSG_OFFICIAL_REFERENCES; 57 exact pinned release entries; 26 critical KV source/media hash readbacks passed. Both independent actual frontend pages passed isolated browser intercept SPIN/recovery QA, not real ETB. Public /new74 routes still 404 because main Player wrapper was not deployed; release pins published=false until authoritative math and real Player ledger certification.",
    "2026-11-21: All 57/57 pinned KV assets read back with SHA-256 and size verified; both mobile layouts passed 16/16 viewport checks from 320px to 1440px; wager availability lock regressions passed in browser import QA; none of these authorize real-money games.",
    "2026-11-21: Reassembled both saved first-party official demos from Cloudflare KV chunk manifests, extracted PayTable.Coeffs, frame linePlay, multiplier values and original menu rules/screenshot. Multi Hot 20 20 lines, Burn Wilds 5 lines, both 5x3. Provider RTP distribution, reel strips, real payline shapes and wheel RNG weights remain unverified; no production outcome sampling enabled.",
    "2026-11-21: Committed independent integer-cent server evaluator official-math.mjs, schema-accurate existing sw_nine PostgreSQL adapter sw-nine-pg-adapter.mjs and 26 successful Node tests, all in branch work/native72-session-presentation-20261119. Uses original sw_rebuild wallet/transfers/ledger and sw_nine game_rounds, no new API/DB; mock DB tested, not deployed to Railway. Committed fixes to both session modules so fresh-state requests include exact gameId rather than receiving default Multi Hot 10.",
    "2026-11-21: Caught and FIXED 2x incorrect Burn Wilds payout: original MachineInfo.FoundationBet=2 (M20=1), provider help formula coeff*totalBet/linePlay/FoundationBet; official screenshot Five Sevens at DMO 0.10 paid DMO 10.00. Corrected server math with integer cents, accepted only payline*foundation divisibility, 27/27 actual Node tests pass. Work branch only; no real ETB wagering, no Railway deployment."
